Port/modification notice, 2026-11-07:
The Pascal/Lazarus GUI has been replaced with a Python CLI. The port adapts
its mode catalog, model definitions, protocol encoding and decoding, and
software constant-resistance behavior. It adds host-supervised profiles,
strict frame validation, CSV logging and replay, and hardware-free tests.
